            "source": [
                "# 01 - Quantum Computing Basics\n",
                "\n",
                "This notebook introduces the basic concepts of quantum computing using Qiskit.\n",
                "\n",
                "The goal is to understand:\n",
                "\n",
                "- classical bits vs quantum bits\n",
